{"_id":"67840a35c30c04fffadd71ab","title":"Baldy To KJ","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d29","gameId":10449761463,"name":"The Strongest Battlegrounds","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/12e823761e273e05e89522420d829de32f467ea49f522abf4779fc12a878d0ac.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-68c92fc62a8753793f7963e146b5197f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"10449761463-the-strongest-battlegrounds","path":"/game/10449761463-the-strongest-battlegrounds","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/12e823761e273e05e89522420d829de32f467ea49f522abf4779fc12a878d0ac.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-68c92fc62a8753793f7963e146b5197f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":10449761463},"slug":"KJ-The-Strongest-Battlegrounds-Baldy-To-KJ-26712","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":31831,"executes":1024,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0ce8d1d1b1bf611e26d277dc82bafbaddfcf0e4a43fd56203457dcf323ea236f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/10449761463-1736706612900.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/10449761463-1736706612900.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0ce8d1d1b1bf611e26d277dc82bafbaddfcf0e4a43fd56203457dcf323ea236f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/10449761463-1736706612900.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/10449761463-1736706612900.png"},"likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-01-12T18:30:13.091Z","updatedAt":"2025-01-12T18:30:13.091Z","lastBump":"2025-01-12T18:30:13.091Z","script":"----<< BOOTLEG KJ / Baldy To KJ / KaitamJ >>----\n--[[ Credits: \n- i.am.an.agent : Script Developer\n- _1.8e308 : Revival Of Script, Script Developer\n]]\n\n--// BUILD January 11 12:00 PM GMT+8 by i.am.an.agent\n\ngetgenv().Moveset_Settings = {\n    [\"ExecuteOnRespawn\"] = true, --// If true, the moveset will load everytime you respawn\n\n    [\"TSBStyleNotification\"] = true, --// If true, uses the TSB notification when you spawn in with KJ\n\n    [\"UseOldCollateralRuin\"] = true, --// If true, uses the old Collateral Ruin VFX and SFX\n\n    [\"NoWarning\"] = true, --// If true, removes the warning that appears when you're not on Saitama\n    [\"NoDeathCounterImages\"] = false, --// If true, will disable the images that appear in death counter slap\n    [\"NoBarrageArms\"] = false, --// If true, will destroy the barrage arms that appear when you use consecutive punch\n    [\"NoPreysPerilAttract\"] = true, --// If true, preys peril will not be able to attract you.\n    [\"NoWalls\"] = false,\n    [\"NoTrees\"] = false,\n\n    [\"RavageTool\"] = true,\n    [\"AdrenalineBoostTool\"] = true,\n    [\"Adrenaline_Multiplier\"] = 2, --// how much adrenaline multiplies your speed by\n\n    [\"CustomUppercutAnimation\"] = true,\n    [\"CustomDownslamAnimation\"] = true,\n    [\"CustomIdleAnimation\"] = true,\n\n    [\"UltNames\"] = {\n        \"20 SERIES\",\n        \"COME AT ME\",\n        \"I'M DONE\",\n    },\n\n    [\"MoveNames\"] = {\n        [\"Normal Punch\"] = \"Ravaging Kick\",\n        [\"Consecutive Punches\"] = \"Fist Fusillade\",\n        [\"Shove\"] = \"Swift Sweep\",\n        [\"Uppercut\"] = \"Collateral Storm\",\n\n        [\"Death Counter\"] = \"Sudden Strike\",\n        [\"Table Flip\"] = \"Stoic Bomb\",\n        [\"Serious Punch\"] = \"Destructive Power\",\n        [\"Omni Directional Punch\"] = \"Omni Directional Fists\"\n    },\n}\n\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skibiditoiletfan2007/BaldyToKJ/refs/heads/main/Latest.lua\"))()","features":"NOT CREATED BY ME AT ALL. Creds go to i.am.an.agent or kade and _1.8e308 on discord! If they wish for me to take this down, I will comply and do so. Here is their discord server: https://discord.gg/SUhvcJnK\n\nReally good Saitama to KJ script by kade and _1.8e308, props to them!\n\n20-20-20 Dropkick - Hold W while using Destructive Power (Serious Punch)\nFaster Five Seasons - Use Five Seasons again while in the floating camera state.","tags":["KJ","Custom Moveset","Moveset","The Strongest Battlegrounds","OP"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6686648c866aebe672fb92d0","username":"echulk","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7e1dd223b4f35de8bbe70929225d70892070add925092c0069e43fad6c5c4127.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6686648c866aebe672fb92d0-1725809873964.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"6686648c866aebe672fb92d0","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7e1dd223b4f35de8bbe70929225d70892070add925092c0069e43fad6c5c4127.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6686648c866aebe672fb92d0-1725809873964.jpg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-24T02:54:19.880Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e7b360710ec3c541a7","editBy":{"_id":"6686648c866aebe672fb92d0","username":"echulk","status":"offline","id":"6686648c866aebe672fb92d0"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-03-27T23:12:32.197Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"67fcf806b5e1e2a41eaaab5e","commentBy":{"_id":"66793390b983f268dc2b200e","username":"fuse","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e1094bc388a4cf8f355259e1309c7d1ddb88dd5f73a87b4c4e60a5df067deea8.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66793390b983f268dc2b200e-1744142850753.png"},"createdAt":"2024-06-24T08:51:28.615Z","lastActive":"2026-09-01T15:13:19.118Z","status":"offline","id":"66793390b983f268dc2b200e","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e1094bc388a4cf8f355259e1309c7d1ddb88dd5f73a87b4c4e60a5df067deea8.webp","original":"https://scriptblox